# Cursor Rules for IQArchive Codebase

- Strictly use centralized design tokens defined in `resources/css/app.css` (`@theme` block).
- Do NOT use raw hex codes (e.g. `#1b355a`, `#002b61`, `#f27224`, `#f47920`, `#f4f6fa`, `#f8fafc`).
- Do NOT use arbitrary font size utilities (e.g. `text-[9px]`, `text-[10px]`, `text-[11px]`, `text-[20px]`).
- Use canonical tokens: `bg-primary`, `bg-primary-dark`, `bg-brand-orange`, `bg-surface-subtle`, `bg-surface-card`, `text-label-xs`, `text-label`, `text-body-sm`, `text-body`, `text-heading-sm`, `text-heading`, `text-heading-lg`, `text-hero`.
- Run `cmd /c npm run build` to verify asset compilation.
